cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the manuscript and this archived release."
type: software
title: "Bistable vegetation-water model of the lower Tarim River"
abstract: >-
  Two-state vegetation-water model with an Allee threshold that depends on
  water stress and effective water supply, together with the MODIS-derived
  corridor tables for the lower Tarim River (2000-2023) and the scripts that
  reproduce every number and figure in the manuscript.
authors:
